request.description:
Increment share count and get updated sharesCount.
The shareable deep-link URL to embed in social media:
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/share/{{contentId}}

Get video player data for a movie.

Pass the movie `_id` as `contentId`.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "content": { title, thumbnail, genres, cast, crew, related },
  "currentEpisode": {
    "hlsUrl": "...",
    "videoSettings": [ { key, label, url, requiresPlan, isLocked } ],
    "watchProgress": { progressSeconds, durationSeconds, progressPercent },
    "isLocked": false
  },
  "playbackSpeeds": [...],
  "userAccess": { userPlan, canAccessCurrentEpisode, requiresSubscription }
}
```

